      "source_span": "Chapter 2, section 2.5 Choice of reference",
      "sparse_rank": 3,
      "text": "Unsurprisingly, the choice of reference has a major impact on the annotation results. We need to pick a reference that contains a superset of the labels that we expect to be present in our test dataset. We would also prefer a reference that is generated from a similar technology or protocol as our test dataset.",
